1
00:00:47,159 --> 00:00:48,439
Li Xiao.

2
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,640
Haven't you always wanted to see the true god?

3
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,880
Let me show you.

4
00:00:54,159 --> 00:00:57,399
I originally wanted to use you

5
00:00:57,399 --> 00:00:58,920
to lure your father out

6
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:01,920
to face the truth from twenty years ago with Mei Yuanhe.

7
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:04,079
Too bad his time was up,

8
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:07,760
so you'll have to see it for him.

9
00:01:51,359 --> 00:01:52,239
Young Master

10
00:01:52,239 --> 00:01:52,959
That lock...

11
00:01:52,959 --> 00:01:54,120
Isn't that...

12
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:03,480
Father... Mother...

13
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,920
Is that you?

14
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,200
What did you say?

15
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:11,879
They're all Dragon-Seeking Clan members who died here twenty years ago.

16
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,319
Please!

17
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:30,360
Spare me!

18
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,159
I beg you!

19
00:02:32,159 --> 00:02:33,199
It really appeared!

20
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,240
I'm begging you!

21
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:37,560
Spare me!

22
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:38,479
Spare me!

23
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:39,520
Lord Evil God!

24
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:40,639
Once you leave the tomb,

25
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:41,879
everyone will surely submit to you!

26
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:44,800
I will be your most loyal servant.

27
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,639
Spare me! Spare the Mei family!

28
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:48,919
I beg you!

29
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:52,400
I beg you!

30
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,240
Please! Spare the Mei family!

31
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,120
Lord Evil God!

32
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:57,680
What are they worshipping?

33
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:58,879
I don't know.

34
00:02:58,879 --> 00:02:59,520
Isn't it empty?

35
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,439
There's nothing there.

36
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:10,199
Please! Spare the Mei family!

37
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,400
What's wrong, Chun'er?

38
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,719
Mei.

39
00:03:15,719 --> 00:03:16,800
I can't leave.

40
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,599
My brother is still inside.

41
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,599
My father is inside too.

42
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,680
Let's go back together.

43
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,520
I haven't given him the divorce papers yet.

44
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,199
Brother!

45
00:03:46,599 --> 00:03:47,759
Jinzi!

46
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:49,080
Something's wrong with him.

47
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,879
Jinzi!

48
00:03:52,319 --> 00:03:53,439
What's wrong with him?

49
00:03:53,439 --> 00:03:54,159
Brother!

50
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:02,400
What's wrong with him?

51
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,319
Brother, what's wrong?

52
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:04,840
I want more gold!

53
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:05,319
Brother!

54
00:04:05,319 --> 00:04:06,240
I want more gold!

55
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:06,680
Brother!

56
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:07,719
Chun'er!

57
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:08,159
Brother!

58
00:04:08,479 --> 00:04:09,280
Chun'er!

59
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,360
And you said there were no evil spirits.

60
00:04:22,399 --> 00:04:23,759
I think they look a lot like evil spirits.

61
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:32,360
They've completely lost their minds now.

62
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,959
I'm afraid in their eyes,

63
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,040
we've both turned into some kind of treasure.

64
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:36,920
Rat,

65
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,240
did you bring silver needles?

66
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:38,959
I did.

67
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:46,000
Get ready to pierce the Baihui point on top of their heads.

68
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,560
To keep them awake.

69
00:04:47,839 --> 00:04:49,519
I still need to question them.

70
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,040
Okay.

71
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:00,879
Father,

72
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:02,879
Father,

73
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,680
you're here too.

74
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,120
That's wonderful.

75
00:05:10,879 --> 00:05:13,439
Father, your son is about to dominate the world.

76
00:05:13,439 --> 00:05:15,319
I'll use the Evil Entity to achieve great things!

77
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:15,920
I know.

78
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,959
My achievements will be much greater than yours!

79
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,600
Yes, yes.

80
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,959
My good son. My good son.

81
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,480
You truly are Father's good son.

82
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:24,600
From now on, I'll be the king of the world.

83
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,759
And you can be the kid of the world.

84
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:27,680
All right.

85
00:05:31,439 --> 00:05:32,639
I've had enough of you!

86
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,360
Father.

87
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:37,399
I grew up under your control.

88
00:05:37,639 --> 00:05:40,680
And now, I am the king of the world.

89
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,519
Fine, you're the king of the world.

90
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,399
Father.

91
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:48,120
Rest in peace.

92
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:48,759
Rat!

93
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:55,040
Master Zhang.

94
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,680
It's been twenty years.

95
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:03,600
How did you get younger?

96
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:04,720
Mei Yuanhe,

97
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,480
since you've seen me,

98
00:06:06,639 --> 00:06:07,600
why aren't you kneeling?

99
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:09,439
Rejuvenation!

100
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:11,439
It's the art of Rejuvenation!

101
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,920
Master Zhang, hurry and teach it to me!

102
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,040
I want immortality! I want to live forever!

103
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:19,519
This is my ultimate dream after all these years of tomb-raiding!

104
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,639
Have I gotten younger?

105
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:26,720
Let me see.

106
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,120
My hair has gotten thicker too.

107
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:29,160
Wake up!

108
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,319
Baihui at the crown, where all yang converges!

109
00:06:35,319 --> 00:06:37,000
Clear the mind, unblock the blood and qi!

110
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:47,800
Screw you!

111
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:54,319
Are you okay?

112
00:06:58,399 --> 00:06:59,560
Evil God!

113
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,519
Evil God, where are you?

114
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,920
Hurry and give me power!

115
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:04,279
Don't leave me!

116
00:07:04,959 --> 00:07:05,720
Evil God!

117
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,680
Evil God, where are you?

118
00:07:08,879 --> 00:07:10,079
Master Mei.

119
00:07:11,439 --> 00:07:12,839
Are you clear-headed now?

120
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,639
No.

121
00:07:18,439 --> 00:07:19,920
What just happened was real.

122
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:22,240
Now is the illusion!

123
00:07:25,399 --> 00:07:27,000
You stepped on my clansman.

124
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:29,879
I want you to kneel and apologize to him.

125
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:31,360
I didn't do it on purpose!

126
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,959
Then you didn't mean what happened twenty years ago either?

127
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,079
Mei Yuanhe!

128
00:07:38,079 --> 00:07:39,759
Don't you get it by now?

129
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:42,199
There is no Evil Entity at all.

130
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,319
It's all the Pathogens that have bred here for thousands of years.

131
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,879
They interfered with your senses

132
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:51,480
and magnified the desires in your hearts.

133
00:07:51,759 --> 00:07:55,079
Obsession, greed, fear, and violence.

134
00:07:55,199 --> 00:07:58,160
These are the greatest Evil Entities in people's hearts.

135
00:08:00,759 --> 00:08:01,759
Master Mei,

136
00:08:02,519 --> 00:08:03,480
I want you now

137
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:06,120
to face the skeletons of the Zhang clansmen here

138
00:08:06,839 --> 00:08:08,800
and repent for what you did back then!

139
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,399
Speak!

140
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:13,920
What did you do to the Zhang clansmen back then?

141
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:16,319
Chun'er!

142
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:17,759
Chun'er!

143
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,720
A golden hall!

144
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,399
Brother!

145
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,839
Wealth to rival a nation!

146
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,920
It's all mine!

147
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,360
It's all mine!

148
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,079
Chun'er!

149
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:27,560
Brother!

150
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,480
Chun'er!

151
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,160
Why are you guys here?

152
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:31,480
Didn't I tell you to go back?

153
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,000
Oh, you...

154
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:33,759
Father!

155
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:46,399
Enough!

156
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,279
It was us.

157
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:53,480
Back then, we disobeyed the Zhang family's orders

158
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:56,840
and had a falling out with the county warlord.

159
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,639
At the time,

160
00:08:59,519 --> 00:09:03,440
we were a ragtag gang following the Dragon-Seeking Clan.

161
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:07,919
Seeing all that gold and treasure on the ground,

162
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:12,039
we thought we would be set for life.

163
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,279
Tell me,

164
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:16,279
who wouldn't be tempted by such wealth?

165
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,600
What happened next?
